<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Marlin says talks near completion.</title>
<headline>Marlin says talks near completion.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marlin Corporation Ltd said on Monday the due diligence investigation on the acquisition of 58 percent of Kudu Granite Holdings Ltd was near completion.</p>
<p>It said agreement in principle had been reached, subject to conditions precedent, whereby Anglo American Corp of South Africa Ltd would become a 30 percent shareholder in I.E.E., the controlling shareholder of Marlin Holdings Ltd Marlin Corp is a unit of Marlin Holdings.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to exercise caution in their share dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
